      {
        "id": "MelR",
        "name": "鎏金蚀日",
        "description": "梅尔无视距离，对所有带有【夺命残影】层数的敌人进行打击，造成基于【夺命残影】层数的额外伤害。<br><br>【鎏金蚀日】的技能等级会提升【夺命残影】的伤害。",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">被动</span>：<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">夺命残影</span>伤害提升至<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/70/80 + (10% 法术强度))魔法伤害外加每层(3/4/5 + (0.75% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">主动</span>：梅尔对所有身上带有<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">夺命残影</span>的敌人释放她的能量，造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(125/200/275 + (30% 法术强度))魔法伤害外加每层<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">夺命残影</span>(4/7/10 + (4% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">仅可在有一名敌方英雄被施加了<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">夺命残影</span>时施放。</span>",
